@SkyRoute_HostAddress = http://localhost:5133

### Search 1 — COR→MDZ today (10 flights across both providers)
GET {{SkyRoute_HostAddress}}/api/Flights?originAirportCode=COR&destinationAirportCode=MDZ&departureDate={{$datetime 'yyyy-MM-dd'}}&passengers=1&cabinClass=Economy&timeZone=America/Argentina/Cordoba

###

### Search 2 — EZE→GRU tomorrow (4 flights, 2 per provider)
GET {{SkyRoute_HostAddress}}/api/Flights?originAirportCode=EZE&destinationAirportCode=GRU&departureDate={{$datetime 'yyyy-MM-dd' 1 d}}&passengers=1&cabinClass=Economy&timeZone=UTC

###

### Search 3 — GRU→EZE tomorrow (4 flights, 2 per provider)
GET {{SkyRoute_HostAddress}}/api/Flights?originAirportCode=GRU&destinationAirportCode=EZE&departureDate={{$datetime 'yyyy-MM-dd' 1 d}}&passengers=1&cabinClass=Economy&timeZone=UTC

###

### Search 4 — EZE→SCL in 3 days (3 flights)
GET {{SkyRoute_HostAddress}}/api/Flights?originAirportCode=EZE&destinationAirportCode=SCL&departureDate={{$datetime 'yyyy-MM-dd' 3 d}}&passengers=2&cabinClass=Economy&timeZone=UTC

###

### Search 5 — EZE→COR today (1 flight, time-dependent — BW101 departs 06:40 UTC)
GET {{SkyRoute_HostAddress}}/api/Flights?originAirportCode=EZE&destinationAirportCode=COR&departureDate={{$datetime 'yyyy-MM-dd'}}&passengers=1&cabinClass=Economy&timeZone=UTC

